---
import WorkspaceIllustration from './WorkspaceIllustration.astro';
import ResearchIcon from '../ResearchIcon.astro';
---

<section class="home-hero" aria-labelledby="hero-heading">
  <div class="site-container hero-grid">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">Annotated Research Context</p>
      <h1 id="hero-heading">Your research put into <span class="hero-context">context<span class="hero-period">.</span></span></h1>
      <div class="hero-description">
        <p>ARC RDM builds on three annotation principles that connect research data with context:</p>
        <ul class="principle-list" role="list">
          <li>
            <ResearchIcon icon="administrative" />
            <span><a href="/details/identity-by-governance/">Identity by Governance</a> establishes identity, responsibility, and reuse conditions.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <ResearchIcon icon="semantic" />
            <span><a href="/details/identity-by-assignment/">Identity by Assignment</a> expresses scientific meaning and interpretations.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <ResearchIcon icon="provenance" />
            <span><a href="/details/identity-by-provenance/">Identity by Provenance</a> describes the activities that use and produce research objects.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p>Use them independently or together as your research evolves.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="button-primary" href="/details/data-management-principle/">
          Get to know ARC RDM <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
        <a class="button-secondary" href="/details/arc-representation/">Explore the system</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <WorkspaceIllustration />
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .home-hero { padding-block: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4.5rem) clamp(3rem, 5vw, 4.5rem); }
  .hero-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); gap: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem); }
  .hero-copy { text-align: center; }
  .hero-copy .eyebrow { font-size: 1rem; letter-spacing: clamp(.06em, .3vw, .14em); }
  h1 { color: var(--site-ink); font-size: clamp(2.65rem, 5.2vw, 4.5rem); font-weight: 650; letter-spacing: -.065em; line-height: 1.08; margin: 1rem 0 1.25rem; }
  .hero-context { display: inline-block; color: var(--site-primary); }
  .hero-period { color: var(--site-accent); }
  .hero-description { color: var(--site-muted); font-size: clamp(1.0625rem, 1.5vw, 1.15rem); line-height: 1.75; max-width: 70ch; margin-inline: auto; }
  .hero-description a { color: var(--site-accent); white-space: nowrap; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: .2em; }
  .hero-description a:hover { text-decoration-thickness: 2px; }
  .principle-list { display: grid; gap: .55rem; width: max-content; max-width: 100%; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: .9rem auto; text-align: start; }
  .principle-list li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.1em minmax(0, 1fr); column-gap: .55em; }
  .principle-list :global(svg) { width: 1.1em; height: 1.1em; margin-top: .325em; color: var(--site-accent); }
  .hero-actions { display: flex; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .75rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
  .hero-actions a { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 1rem; }
  @media (max-width: 380px) { .hero-actions { flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; } }
</style>

